            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "云果",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_200302801_3025332646_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "{A惊叹}我觉得比我一个人种出来，\n还要开心，还要……{短暂停}<style=SizeBig>有成就感！</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_200302801_3025332646_content",
                "value": "{A惊叹}我觉得比我一个人种出来，\n还要开心，还要……{短暂停}<style=SizeBig>有成就感！</style>"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3025332646
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "云果",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_200302801_3025332647_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "我很久、很久，没和谁一起种过东西了……{短暂停}\n你让我，想起了合作的感觉，谢谢你！\n<style=SizeSmall>像太阳一样照着我。</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_200302801_3025332647_content",
                "value": "我很久、很久，没和谁一起种过东西了……{短暂停}\n你让我，想起了合作的感觉，谢谢你！\n<style=SizeSmall>像太阳一样照着我。</style>"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3025332647
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "云果",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_200302801_3025332648_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "之前是我钻牛角尖，\n独立生活不是我自己一个人做所有事，\n也不是孤独的生活。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_200302801_3025332648_content",
                "value": "之前是我钻牛角尖，\n独立生活不是我自己一个人做所有事，\n也不是孤独的生活。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3025332648
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "云果",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
