                "textId": "Performance_200302801_3025332659_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "那个嘛，我想给姥姥也看看这里……\n我们一起和作物园拍照，好嘛？",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_200302801_3025332659_content",
                "value": "那个嘛，我想给姥姥也看看这里……\n我们一起和作物园拍照，好嘛？"
